sequenceDiagram

participant Business
participant Adapter
participant Preferred
participant Classical

Business->>Adapter: optimize(request)

Adapter->>Preferred: solve(request)

alt Preferred succeeds
    Preferred-->>Adapter: optimization result
    Adapter-->>Business: result

else Preferred fails

    Preferred--x Adapter: exception

    Adapter->>Classical: solve(request)

    Classical-->>Adapter: fallback result

    Adapter-->>Business: result

end